  "description": "Rookie director Lee Suh-Rim is at his wit’s end. Lee Su-Noh, the hottest star around, joined Suh-Rim’s project but keeps skipping production meetings. Soon, the whole production might fall apart before it can begin. Out of options, Suh-Rim decides to cash in on a secret only he knows about the actor. Years ago, he paid Su-Noh for something special... something that Su-Noh has not yet delivered. So now, Su-Noh owes him... with 50% interest. Will this leverage help Suh-Rim? Or will it be the final nail?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
